<Base title="Privacy"><div class="page-shell"><PageHeading title="Your visit, explained." eyebrow="Privacy" description="What this public website does with your browser and account information."/><div class="prose"><h2>Public browsing</h2><p>This website does not use analytics, advertising trackers, or account cookies. Its pages and images are delivered by Firebase Hosting. Hosting providers may process request information, such as IP addresses and browser headers, to deliver and protect the service.</p><h2>Search and player ratings</h2><p>Search runs in your browser using an index downloaded from this website. Search terms are not sent to an account service. The competition page downloads a public ratings snapshot from Google Cloud Storage without sending account credentials. Published ratings include players’ public usernames, ratings, and game counts.</p><h2>The game and online accounts</h2><p>Choosing Play or Log in opens the separate online app at app.glob2online.com. Game saves, multiplayer connections, account registration, and sign-in are handled there. The app has separate account and data handling; this website does not store your login credentials.</p><h2>External community links</h2><p>Links to GitHub, the legacy wiki, and other community services take you to those services. Their own privacy policies apply.</p><h2>Contact the project</h2><p>For a website privacy question, use the <a href="https://github.com/Globulation2/glob2-website/issues">website repository</a>. Avoid posting passwords, account tokens, or other private information in a public issue.</p></div></div></Base>
